  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Hello, kind Trainer. I’m Trice. I work for the postal\nservice here in Lumiose.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "This Pokémon, Mime Jr., is here to help us collect\nmail from our customers.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Miii.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006900690069002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I’ve got one minor concern. You see, this will\nbe Mime Jr.’s first time going out solo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I thought about trying to follow along to keep an\neye on things, but I’d be spotted in no time.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That’s why I’d like to ask for your assistance.\nPlease, look after Mime Jr.’s first big job for me!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you’re ready and willing to lend a hand, please\nlet me know.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006600200079006F007520190072006500200072006500610064007900200061006E0064002000770069006C006C0069006E006700200074006F0020006C0065006E006400200061002000680061006E0064002C00200070006C0065006100730065000A006C006500740020006D00650020006B006E006F0077002E00100002011401BF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Are you ready to help watch over Mime Jr.’s first\ntime making the rounds alone?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m all ready",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D00200061006C006C0020007200650061006400790000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Maybe later",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00610079006200650020006C00610074006500720000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I know it’s a lot to ask. But I only want to be sure\nMime Jr. is safe, so I hope you’ll help out!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Thank you so much!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005400680061006E006B00200079006F007500200073006F0020006D007500630068002100100002011401BF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll give Mime Jr. one last set of instructions. You\njust follow along and keep an eye on things.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƿ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1892,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
